IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0010.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CA-AGE             PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 T-AMT1             PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 WS-CTRY            PIC X(2).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 R-IND              PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-TXN
    PERFORM HIGH-RISK-REGION
    DISPLAY "R-IND=" R-IND
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-TXN.
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR
    IF CA-AGE < 16 AND T-AMT1 > 3000
        MOVE 'Y' TO R-IND
    END-IF.
HIGH-RISK-REGION.
    *> LARGE TRANSACTION FROM HIGH-RISK REGION
    IF T-AMT1 > 45000
       AND (WS-CTRY = 'XA' OR WS-CTRY = 'XB')
        MOVE 'Y' TO R-IND
    END-IF.
